<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was slow in the panhandle area late Friday. Slaughter steers and heifers were not well tested at the close.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported limited inquiry from buyers following the weekly movement of 196,000 head. Sales reported on 100 slaughter heifers.</p>
<p>Heifers - pen select and choice 2-3 1050 lbs 72.00.</p>
